  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：ASIC持续爬坡，2Q26营业利润超预期</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">鸿海这份财报最值得看的不是营收本身，而是营业利润率的变化。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营业利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">948亿</span>新台币，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68%</span>，比GS和彭博一致预期分别高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">36%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>。毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.1%</span>，略低于去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.3%</span>，但明显高于GS预期的5.7%。营收增长41%的同时，营业利润率从3.2%抬到3.8%，说明规模扩张没有以利润为代价。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把数字拆开看，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.53万亿</span>新台币，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41%</span>，环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19%</span>。营业费用率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.2%</span>降到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.4%</span>，这是营业利润<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的直接原因。GS在财报后把2026年盈利预测上调1%，主要理由是毛利率高于预期、费用率低于预期。营收预测反而微降，因为非营业项目低于预期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWfcdx9nmybRMk01Mu9AOphgUrjNjMpic1TEamnnicDKsVk0Xp6OlusbM2giaTJapcz8TCQXaLhCVJFzCCSKOdhauQSevKicuKsiaQQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. AI服务器机柜<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>出货环比高双位数增长</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层在交流会上给出了明确的季度指引：AI服务器机柜出货<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>环比增长高双位数，全年出货量在强劲需求和份额提升支撑下会有显著增长。云与网络业务、消费电子、PC、组件及其他四大板块<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>都将实现同比增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份指引的含金量在于它和月度营收数据能对上。7月营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9465亿</span>新台币，同比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54%</span>，环比增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，GS估计8月和9月营收分别达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.03万亿</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.06万亿</span>新台币，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>整体营收预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.04万亿</span>新台币，同比增48%。AI服务器是这轮增长的主引擎，AI交换机也在贡献增量。</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #AAB4C3;background:#F7F8FA;color:#4B5565;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\">简单说，机柜单价高、配置复杂，环比高双位数增长意味着产能爬坡和客户拉货都在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>；我更关注的是后续季度能否维持这个增速，因为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>基数已经很高。</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW7LSeqmuh1Ebxiaia8dMPWpBteoVso52VwUDfdo7r3WDle3Cr5qfsghg2Gt9SssQo7U3evialIu8DW6NbHBR8oeiaQg1FEcrEPnT0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 毛利率微降但费用率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>抵消了不确定性</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.1%</span>，比去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.3%</span>低0.2个百分点，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>低0.1个百分点。表面看是毛利率在往下走，但营业费用率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.2%</span>降到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.4%</span>，把毛利率的不确定性完全抵消了。净利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.4%</span>，基本持平。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>的毛利率预测分别是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.9%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.3%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.5%</span>，逐年节奏变化。这看起来矛盾：AI服务器占比越高，毛利率反而越低。原因在于AI服务器虽然收入体量大，但毛利率未必高于消费电子。鸿海的利润增长更多靠费用控制和规模效应，而不是单品利润率提升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，鸿海的经营杠杆在起作用。营收增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41%</span>，营业利润增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">68%</span>，利润增速是收入增速的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.6倍</span>。费用率下降0.8个百分点，在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.5万亿</span>新台币的营收基数上，相当于多出约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">200亿</span>新台币的营业利润。这才是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的核心机制。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUQ1ea6yoMuQqs9e3Fia6MmicYRM4ebKLALNmIHHshsLud4AIBImpZrBibfpCRgpe9icx8Ne5cTRGBlykgy9jIAQNWQcANfocpCHKo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 电动车业务进入交付阶段但贡献仍小</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">电动车方面，Model B预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>底在澳大利亚和新西兰交付，CAVIRA在中国台湾从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年7月开始交付。这些进展说明鸿海的电动车代工业务从签约阶段进入交付阶段，但财报里没有单独披露电动车收入，目前对整体利润的贡献仍然有限。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS对鸿海的长期逻辑是：从消费电子代工扩展到AI服务器和电动车代工，用垂直整合和全球产能把规模优势转化为长期订单和市场份额。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVfbRtdprIJNiaq0wF02ea4FoI8CK6tTprKYNJlOLlbgW5NlXvibdE42h9KkQ8L3Qic6wnRiaWQH9aXJIXibAiaomqbibnB1BSdN224Wc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 30-GS-Hon Hai -2317.TW-- AI server continuous ramp-up ahead across GPU ASIC- 2Q26 OP beat- 报告观点-on CL--260813</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
